id=usb_fast_44100
name=USB FAST path @44100 (NXTPAPER 14)
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=jgroman
description=Experimental: pins the primary output and FAST mixPorts to 44100 so the device's optimal output rate is 44100 and low-latency USB streams can use a 44100 FAST path (matching a 44.1 kHz USB sink). Reversible.
